<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="generated_at" content="{{ ctx.generated_at.isoformat() }}">
<title>{{ ctx.experiment_name | replace("-", " ") | title }} Experiment — A/B Analysis</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #ffffff;
    --fg: #1f2937;
    --muted: #6b7280;
    --line: #e5e7eb;
    --accent-A: {{ variant_colors["A"] }};
    --accent-B: {{ variant_colors["B"] }};
    --good: #d1fae5;
    --bad: #fee2e2;
    --warn: #fef3c7;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body {
    margin: 0; padding: 0;
    background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg);
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  main { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px; }
  h1 { font-size: 28px; margin: 0 0 8px 0; }
  h2 { font-size: 22px; margin: 32px 0 12px 0; padding-bottom: 6px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--line); }
  h3 { font-size: 18px; margin: 20px 0 8px 0; color: var(--fg); }
  p { margin: 8px 0; }
  .muted { color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 12px 0; font-size: 14px; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 8px 10px; text-align: right; }
  th { background: #f9fafb; text-align: left; }
  td:first-child, th:first-child { text-align: left; }
  tbody tr:nth-child(even) { background: #fafafa; }
  .verdict { font-weight: 700; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 4px; }
  .verdict-ship { background: var(--good); color: #065f46; }
  .verdict-do_not_ship { background: var(--bad); color: #991b1b; }
  .verdict-inconclusive { background: var(--warn); color: #92400e; }
  .sig-positive { background: var(--good); }
  .sig-negative { background: var(--bad); }
  .chart { margin: 12px 0 24px 0; }
  .grid-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }
  footer { margin-top: 48px; padding: 16px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .swatch-A { display: inline-block; width: 12px; height: 12px; background: var(--accent-A); border-radius: 2px; margin-right: 4px; vertical-align: middle; }
  .swatch-B { display: inline-block; width: 12px; height: 12px; background: var(--accent-B); border-radius: 2px; margin-right: 4px; vertical-align: middle; }
</style>
<script>{{ plotly_bundle|safe }}</script>
</head>
<body>
<main>

<h1>{{ ctx.experiment_name | replace("-", " ") | title }} Experiment — A/B Analysis</h1>
<p class="muted">
  Date range: {{ ctx.date_range[0].strftime('%Y-%m-%d') }} → {{ ctx.date_range[1].strftime('%Y-%m-%d') }}
  · <span class="swatch-A"></span>Variant A (control)
  · <span class="swatch-B"></span>Variant B (treatment)
</p>

{# ============== EXECUTIVE SUMMARY ============== #}
<section id="exec-summary">
<h2>Summary</h2>
{% if ctx.exec_summary %}
<p><strong>Recommendation:</strong>
  {% if ctx.exec_summary.recommendation == "ship" %}
    <span class="verdict verdict-ship">SHIP</span>
  {% elif ctx.exec_summary.recommendation == "do_not_ship" %}
    <span class="verdict verdict-do_not_ship">DO NOT SHIP</span>
  {% else %}
    <span class="verdict verdict-inconclusive">INCONCLUSIVE — needs more data</span>
  {% endif %}
</p>
<p>{{ ctx.exec_summary.headline_engagement }}</p>
<p>{{ ctx.exec_summary.headline_redirect }}</p>
<p><em>{{ ctx.exec_summary.rationale }}</em></p>
{% else %}
<p class="ai-summary-placeholder"><em>AI summary not yet generated. Call <code>generate_ai_summary(ctx)</code> and re-render to populate this section.</em></p>
{% endif %}
</section>

{# ============== DATA OVERVIEW ============== #}
<section id="data-overview">
<h2>Data Overview</h2>
<div style="display:flex; gap:32px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
<table style="width:auto;">
  <thead><tr><th>File</th><th>Rows loaded</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>ots_chat.csv</td><td>{{ "{:,}".format(ctx.chat_rows) }}</td></tr>
    <tr><td>redirects.csv</td><td>{{ "{:,}".format(ctx.redirect_rows) }}</td></tr>
    <tr>
      <td>actions.csv</td>
      <td>{% if ctx.action_rows is not none %}{{ "{:,}".format(ctx.action_rows) }}{% else %}<span class="muted">not loaded</span>{% endif %}</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
<table style="width:auto;">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Variant</th>
      <th>Distinct session_ids in chat (backend)</th>
      <th>Distinct session_ids in actions (frontend)</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td>A (control)</td>
      <td>{{ "{:,}".format(ctx.variant_population.A) }}</td>
      <td>{% if ctx.action_population %}{{ "{:,}".format(ctx.action_population.A) }}{% else %}<span class="muted">—</span>{% endif %}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>B (treatment)</td>
      <td>{{ "{:,}".format(ctx.variant_population.B) }}</td>
      <td>{% if ctx.action_population %}{{ "{:,}".format(ctx.action_population.B) }}{% else %}<span class="muted">—</span>{% endif %}</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
</div>
{% if ctx.excluded_session_ids_count > 0 %}
<p class="muted">{{ ctx.excluded_session_ids_count }} session_id(s) excluded due to in-file variant conflict.</p>
{% endif %}
</section>

{# ============== ENGAGEMENT ============== #}
<section id="engagement">
<h2>Engagement Analysis</h2>

{# --- Block 1: Backend chat data (INTENT_RECOGNITION rates) --- #}
<h3>Block 1: Backend chat engagement</h3>
{% set _intent_map = {} %}
{% for m in ctx.engagement_metrics %}
  {% if "INTENT" in m.chat_type %}{% set _ = _intent_map.update({m.dimension: m}) %}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
<table style="width:auto">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Dimension</th>
      <th>A count</th><th>A rate</th>
      <th>B count</th><th>B rate</th>
      <th>Rel. lift</th>
      <th>p-value</th>
      <th>Verdict</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {% for dim in ["session_id", "request_id", "correlation_id"] %}
    {% set intent = _intent_map[dim] %}
    <tr>
      <td>{{ dim }}</td>
      <td>{{ "{:,}".format(intent.count_A) }}</td>
      <td>{{ intent.value_A|fmt_pct }}</td>
      <td>{{ "{:,}".format(intent.count_B) }}</td>
      <td>{{ intent.value_B|fmt_pct }}</td>
      <td>{{ intent.rel_lift_pct|fmt_lift }}</td>
      <td>{{ intent.p_value|fmt_p }}</td>
      <td>{{ intent.directional_verdict }} / {{ intent.significance_verdict.replace('_', ' ') }}</td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
<dl class="muted" style="margin:8px 0 0 0; display:grid; grid-template-columns:max-content 1fr; gap:2px 12px; font-size:13px;">
  <dt><strong>Rate</strong></dt><dd>INTENT_RECOGNITION distinct count / total chat (SUGGESTIONS + INTENT) distinct count, per dimension.</dd>
  <dt><strong>p-value</strong></dt><dd>Two-proportion z-test (α = 0.05).</dd>
</dl>

{# --- Block 2: Rounds per session --- #}
<h3>Block 2: Rounds per session (Welch's t-test)</h3>
<table style="width:auto">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Variant</th><th>Sessions</th><th>Rounds (Mean)</th><th>Rounds (Median)</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>A</td><td>{{ "{:,}".format(ctx.rounds_metric.n_sessions_A) }}</td><td>{{ ctx.rounds_metric.mean_A|fmt_num(2) }}</td><td>{{ ctx.rounds_metric.median_A|fmt_num(2) }}</td></tr>
    <tr><td>B</td><td>{{ "{:,}".format(ctx.rounds_metric.n_sessions_B) }}</td><td>{{ ctx.rounds_metric.mean_B|fmt_num(2) }}</td><td>{{ ctx.rounds_metric.median_B|fmt_num(2) }}</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
<p>Δ mean = {{ ctx.rounds_metric.abs_diff_mean|fmt_num(3) }} ·
   relative lift = {{ ctx.rounds_metric.rel_lift_mean_pct|fmt_lift }} ·
   p = {{ ctx.rounds_metric.p_value|fmt_p }} ·
   {{ ctx.rounds_metric.directional_verdict }} / {{ ctx.rounds_metric.significance_verdict.replace('_', ' ') }}</p>

{# --- Block 3: Load → click / chat funnel --- #}
<h3>Block 3: Frontend funnel: load → click → chat</h3>
{% macro funnel_table(f) %}
<table style="width:auto">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Step</th>
      <th>A count</th><th>A rate</th>
      <th>B count</th><th>B rate</th>
      <th>Rel. lift</th>
      <th>p-value</th>
      <th>Verdict</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td>Load (denominator)</td>
      <td>{{ "{:,}".format(f.load_A) }}</td><td>—</td>
      <td>{{ "{:,}".format(f.load_B) }}</td><td>—</td>
      <td>—</td><td>—</td><td>—</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Click</td>
      <td>{{ "{:,}".format(f.click_A) }}</td><td>{{ f.click_rate_A|fmt_pct }}</td>
      <td>{{ "{:,}".format(f.click_B) }}</td><td>{{ f.click_rate_B|fmt_pct }}</td>
      <td>{{ f.click_rel_lift_pct|fmt_lift }}</td>
      <td>{{ f.click_p_value|fmt_p }}</td>
      <td>{{ f.click_directional_verdict }} / {{ f.click_significance_verdict.replace('_', ' ') }}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Chat</td>
      <td>{{ "{:,}".format(f.chat_A) }}</td><td>{{ f.chat_rate_A|fmt_pct }}</td>
      <td>{{ "{:,}".format(f.chat_B) }}</td><td>{{ f.chat_rate_B|fmt_pct }}</td>
      <td>{{ f.chat_rel_lift_pct|fmt_lift }}</td>
      <td>{{ f.chat_p_value|fmt_p }}</td>
      <td>{{ f.chat_directional_verdict }} / {{ f.chat_significance_verdict.replace('_', ' ') }}</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
{% endmacro %}
{% if ctx.load_funnel_metric %}
<h4>Combined</h4>
{{ funnel_table(ctx.load_funnel_metric) }}
<h4>Parallel search</h4>
<p class="muted">Sessions with ≥1 CHAT_BOX_ENTRY_LOADED row where traffic_source = parallel_search.</p>
{{ funnel_table(ctx.load_funnel_parallel) }}
<h4>Non-parallel search</h4>
<p class="muted">Sessions with ≥1 CHAT_BOX_ENTRY_LOADED row but no traffic_source = parallel_search row.</p>
{{ funnel_table(ctx.load_funnel_non_parallel) }}
<dl class="muted" style="margin:8px 0 0 0; display:grid; grid-template-columns:max-content 1fr; gap:2px 12px; font-size:13px;">
  <dt><strong>Load</strong></dt><dd>Distinct session_ids with CHAT_BOX_ENTRY_LOADED in actions.csv.</dd>
  <dt><strong>Click</strong></dt><dd>Distinct session_ids with CHAT_BOX_ENTRY_CLICK / load session_ids.</dd>
  <dt><strong>Chat</strong></dt><dd>Distinct session_ids with CHAT_TYPE_INTENT_RECOGNITION in ots_chat / load session_ids.</dd>
  <dt><strong>Parallel / Non-parallel split</strong></dt><dd>Based on actions.csv traffic_source for each session's CHAT_BOX_ENTRY_LOADED row(s); a session with any such row equal to parallel_search is counted as parallel search.</dd>
</dl>
{% else %}
<p class="muted"><em>actions.csv not loaded — funnel unavailable.</em></p>
{% endif %}
</section>

{# ============== REDIRECT & BOOKING ============== #}
<section id="redirect">
<h2>Conversion Analysis</h2>
<p class="muted">
  Redirect count: distinct dimension values matched to a redirect via (session_id, correlation_id ↔ pre_redirect_id).<br>
  Booking count: redirect-matched rows further restricted to redirects.is_booking = 1.<br>
  p-value: two-proportion z-test (α = 0.05).
</p>

{# ---- Block 1: Overall redirect ---- #}
<h3>Block 1: Overall redirect</h3>
<p class="muted">All users: distinct dimension values across all chat rows (SUGGESTIONS + INTENT).</p>
<table style="width:auto">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th rowspan="2">Dimension</th>
      <th colspan="3" style="text-align:center">A</th>
      <th colspan="3" style="text-align:center">B</th>
      <th rowspan="2">Δ (pp)</th>
      <th rowspan="2">Rel. lift</th>
      <th rowspan="2">p-value</th>
      <th rowspan="2">Verdict</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th>All users</th><th style="width:100px">Redirect count</th><th>Rate</th>
      <th>All users</th><th style="width:100px">Redirect count</th><th>Rate</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {% for m in ctx.redirect_metrics_all if m.dimension != "chat_session_id" %}
    <tr>
      <td>{{ m.dimension }}</td>
      <td>{{ "{:,}".format(m.denominator_A) }}</td>
      <td>{{ "{:,}".format(m.numerator_A) }}</td>
      <td>{{ m.rate_A|fmt_pct }}</td>
      <td>{{ "{:,}".format(m.denominator_B) }}</td>
      <td>{{ "{:,}".format(m.numerator_B) }}</td>
      <td>{{ m.rate_B|fmt_pct }}</td>
      <td>{{ m.abs_diff|fmt_pp }}</td>
      <td>{{ m.rel_lift_pct|fmt_lift }}</td>
      <td>{{ m.p_value|fmt_p }}</td>
      <td>{{ m.directional_verdict }} / {{ m.significance_verdict.replace('_', ' ') }}</td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>

{# ---- Block 2: Overall booking ---- #}
<h3>Block 2: Overall booking</h3>
<p class="muted">All users: distinct dimension values across all chat rows (SUGGESTIONS + INTENT), restricted to is_booking = 1.</p>
<table style="width:auto">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th rowspan="2">Dimension</th>
      <th colspan="3" style="text-align:center">A</th>
      <th colspan="3" style="text-align:center">B</th>
      <th rowspan="2">Δ (pp)</th>
      <th rowspan="2">Rel. lift</th>
      <th rowspan="2">p-value</th>
      <th rowspan="2">Verdict</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th>All users</th><th style="width:100px">Booking count</th><th>Rate</th>
      <th>All users</th><th style="width:100px">Booking count</th><th>Rate</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {% for m in ctx.booking_metrics_all if m.dimension != "chat_session_id" %}
    <tr>
      <td>{{ m.dimension }}</td>
      <td>{{ "{:,}".format(m.denominator_A) }}</td>
      <td>{{ "{:,}".format(m.numerator_A) }}</td>
      <td>{{ m.rate_A|fmt_pct }}</td>
      <td>{{ "{:,}".format(m.denominator_B) }}</td>
      <td>{{ "{:,}".format(m.numerator_B) }}</td>
      <td>{{ m.rate_B|fmt_pct }}</td>
      <td>{{ m.abs_diff|fmt_pp }}</td>
      <td>{{ m.rel_lift_pct|fmt_lift }}</td>
      <td>{{ m.p_value|fmt_p }}</td>
      <td>{{ m.directional_verdict }} / {{ m.significance_verdict.replace('_', ' ') }}</td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>

{# ---- Block 3: From chat to redirect ---- #}
<h3>Block 3: From chat to redirect</h3>
<p class="muted">Chat users: distinct dimension values among CHAT_TYPE_INTENT_RECOGNITION rows only.</p>
<table style="width:auto">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th rowspan="2">Dimension</th>
      <th colspan="3" style="text-align:center">A</th>
      <th colspan="3" style="text-align:center">B</th>
      <th rowspan="2">Δ (pp)</th>
      <th rowspan="2">Rel. lift</th>
      <th rowspan="2">p-value</th>
      <th rowspan="2">Verdict</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th>Chat users</th><th style="width:100px">Redirect count</th><th>Rate</th>
      <th>Chat users</th><th style="width:100px">Redirect count</th><th>Rate</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {% for m in ctx.redirect_metrics_intent %}
    <tr>
      <td>{{ m.dimension }}</td>
      <td>{{ "{:,}".format(m.denominator_A) }}</td>
      <td>{{ "{:,}".format(m.numerator_A) }}</td>
      <td>{{ m.rate_A|fmt_pct }}</td>
      <td>{{ "{:,}".format(m.denominator_B) }}</td>
      <td>{{ "{:,}".format(m.numerator_B) }}</td>
      <td>{{ m.rate_B|fmt_pct }}</td>
      <td>{{ m.abs_diff|fmt_pp }}</td>
      <td>{{ m.rel_lift_pct|fmt_lift }}</td>
      <td>{{ m.p_value|fmt_p }}</td>
      <td>{{ m.directional_verdict }} / {{ m.significance_verdict.replace('_', ' ') }}</td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>

{# ---- Block 4: From chat to booking ---- #}
<h3>Block 4: From chat to booking</h3>
<p class="muted">Chat users: distinct dimension values among CHAT_TYPE_INTENT_RECOGNITION rows only, restricted to is_booking = 1.</p>
<table style="width:auto">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th rowspan="2">Dimension</th>
      <th colspan="3" style="text-align:center">A</th>
      <th colspan="3" style="text-align:center">B</th>
      <th rowspan="2">Δ (pp)</th>
      <th rowspan="2">Rel. lift</th>
      <th rowspan="2">p-value</th>
      <th rowspan="2">Verdict</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th>Chat users</th><th style="width:100px">Booking count</th><th>Rate</th>
      <th>Chat users</th><th style="width:100px">Booking count</th><th>Rate</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {% for m in ctx.booking_metrics_intent %}
    <tr>
      <td>{{ m.dimension }}</td>
      <td>{{ "{:,}".format(m.denominator_A) }}</td>
      <td>{{ "{:,}".format(m.numerator_A) }}</td>
      <td>{{ m.rate_A|fmt_pct }}</td>
      <td>{{ "{:,}".format(m.denominator_B) }}</td>
      <td>{{ "{:,}".format(m.numerator_B) }}</td>
      <td>{{ m.rate_B|fmt_pct }}</td>
      <td>{{ m.abs_diff|fmt_pp }}</td>
      <td>{{ m.rel_lift_pct|fmt_lift }}</td>
      <td>{{ m.p_value|fmt_p }}</td>
      <td>{{ m.directional_verdict }} / {{ m.significance_verdict.replace('_', ' ') }}</td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
</section>

{# ============== EXPERIMENT-SPECIFIC SECTIONS (plugins) ============== #}
{% for html in plugin_section_htmls %}
{{ html|safe }}
{% endfor %}

{# ============== APPENDIX ============== #}
<section id="appendix">
<h2>Appendix</h2>

<h3>Methodology</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Engagement rate (Block 1):</strong> per-dimension distinct INTENT_RECOGNITION count / per-dimension distinct count across all chat (SUGGESTIONS + INTENT). E.g. for session_id, the rate is the share of users who had at least one INTENT_RECOGNITION row.</li>
  <li><strong>Rounds per session (Block 2):</strong> per INTENT_RECOGNITION session, the maximum <code>rounds</code> value is taken as the session depth. Mean and median are compared across variants; significance is assessed with Welch's t-test.</li>
  <li><strong>Frontend funnel (Block 3):</strong> denominator is distinct session_ids with <code>CHAT_BOX_ENTRY_LOADED</code> in actions.csv. Click rate = ENTRY_CLICK session_ids / load session_ids; chat rate = INTENT_RECOGNITION session_ids (from ots_chat) / load session_ids.</li>
  <li><strong>Redirect attribution:</strong> a chat row is "redirected" iff its <code>correlation_id</code> appears in <code>redirects.pre_redirect_id</code>. SUGGESTIONS rows are excluded from the intent-only table.</li>
  <li><strong>Booking attribution (Blocks 2 &amp; 4):</strong> redirect-attributed rows further filtered to <code>redirects.is_booking == 1</code>. Denominators are unchanged from Block 1 (Block 2) and Block 3 (Block 4).</li>
  <li><strong>Statistical tests:</strong> two-proportion z-test for all rate metrics; Welch's t-test for rounds mean. α = {{ ctx.alpha }}. Two-sided. "significant" iff p &lt; {{ ctx.alpha }}.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Multiple comparisons</h3>
<p>
  This report runs <strong>{{ ctx.total_tests }}</strong> two-sided tests in total at α = {{ ctx.alpha }}.
  At this multiplicity, the expected number of false positives under the null hypothesis is approximately
  <strong>{{ "%.2f"|format(ctx.expected_false_positives) }}</strong>. No multiple-comparisons correction
  is applied. Treat borderline-significant findings with this in mind.
</p>

<h3>Excluded data</h3>
<p>
  {% if ctx.excluded_session_ids_count == 0 %}
    No session_ids excluded.
  {% else %}
    {{ ctx.excluded_session_ids_count }} session_id(s) excluded due to in-file variant conflict in ots_chat.csv.
  {% endif %}
</p>

</section>

<footer>
  Generated {{ ctx.generated_at.strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S UTC') }}
  · Source: ots_chat.csv + redirects.csv{% if ctx.action_rows is not none %} + actions.csv{% endif %}
  · Plotly bundle inlined for offline viewing
</footer>

</main>
</body>
</html>
